<title>INDONESIA: BDNI 1996 net rises to 190.7 bln rph.</title>
<headline>BDNI 1996 net rises to 190.7 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			190.7 vs 140.2</p>
<p>    EPS (in rupiah)		 232.0 vs 171.0</p>
<p>    Total operating income	576.5 vs 442.2</p>
<p>    Total operating expense     329.5 vs 248.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  266.3 vs 197.6</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Bank Dagang Nasional Indonesia (BDNI) is one of Indonesia's largest privately-owned banks.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
